# Run http/auth.http first to store the tokens, and http/subject.http to create the approved "Physics I" subject.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. student1 asks to tutor Physics I -> 201 PENDING
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student1Token}}

{
  "subjectUuid": "{{subjectUuid}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("newBondUuid", response.body.id); %}

### 2. The same request again while it is pending -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student1Token}}

{
  "subjectUuid": "{{subjectUuid}}"
}

### 3. The tutor (regular user) tries to approve student1's bond -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/{{newBondUuid}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}

### 4. Admin approves the bond -> APPROVED (the admin becomes its evaluator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/{{newBondUuid}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. student1 tries to revoke their own bond -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/{{newBondUuid}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{student1Token}}

### 6. Admin revokes the bond -> REVOKED (its future sessions are cancelled)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/{{newBondUuid}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. student2 asks to tutor Physics I and the admin rejects it -> REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{student2Token}}

{
  "subjectUuid": "{{subjectUuid}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("rejectedBondUuid", response.body.id); %}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/{{rejectedBondUuid}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reading. The admin lists every bond, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### The tutor lists only the bonds they requested
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds?status=APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}

### The tutor reads their seeded Calculus I bond -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/0128d64d-7818-4eec-9b8e-a55e8421ab1f
Authorization: Bearer {{tutorToken}}

### A student reads someone else's bond -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutoring-bonds/0128d64d-7818-4eec-9b8e-a55e8421ab1f
Authorization: Bearer {{student1Token}}
